(x * y) * K(y,z) = x * T(y,z).
K(x,y) = 1 / K(T(y,x),x).
1 / K(T(x,y),y) = K(y,x).
K(x,y) = (x * z) \ (T(x,y) * z).
(x * y) \ (T(x,z) * y) = K(x,z).
(T(x,y) * z) / K(x,y) = x * z.
1 / K(x,y) = K(y,x).
K(x,y) * K(y,x) = 1.
K(x,y) \ 1 = K(y,x).
T(x,y) * (z * K(y,x)) = x * z.
